ce/ethnicity and grade.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Then logistic regression analyses were used to assess the presence of a significant linear trend in each segment.\"}], \"confidence\": \"high\", \"uncertain_fields\": []}", "type": "text"}]}